                                            "Pertaining to a dove or pigeon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be740cd7-2433-4575-b941-8c383f4ff976",
                                                "sense_id": "1085f41d-289a-39c8-8941-57bfa138c56a",
                                                "text": "It is not possible to join serpentine wisdom with the columbine innocency, except men know exactly all the conditions of the serpent."
